sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Solicitante (sk)
  participant R as Receiver
  participant USRR as ipm.user Receiver
  participant M as Manager
  participant DB as SSOT (schema ipm)
  participant P as Publisher
  participant REC as Reconciler
  participant OB as Observer
  participant EX as Executor
  participant ST as Banco platform (schema ipm)
  U->>R: GET /v1/ipm/groups/{resourceId}
  R-->>U: 200 com resourceVersion
  U->>R: PATCH /v1/ipm/groups/{resourceId} {resourceVersion, description, roles}
  R->>R: valida ipm.group.update e ipm.group.bind (se roles mudou)
  R->>M: requested-update (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 operationId
  alt resourceVersion diferente da atual
    M->>DB: Operation rejected (conflict), nada muda
  else aceito
    M->>DB: geração + 1, campos novos, outbox desired
    P->>REC: desired (DESIRED)
    REC->>EX: action update (campos diferem)
    EX->>ST: transação: atualiza ipm.group e ipm.group_role
    OB->>M: observed com os campos novos (fase Ready)
  end
  Note over R,EX: DELETE exige deletionProtection = false e nenhum ipm.user associado ao grupo
  U->>R: DELETE /v1/ipm/groups/{resourceId}?resourceVersion=N
  R->>USRR: count_users_with_group(organizationId, name)
  alt há usuários associados ao grupo
    R-->>U: 409 ResourcesAttached
  else sem usuários associados e desprotegido
    R->>M: requested-delete (REQUESTED)
    R-->>U: 202 operationId
    M->>DB: lifecycle absent (Deleting), outbox desired
    P->>REC: desired absent
    REC->>EX: action delete
    EX->>ST: DELETE em ipm.group (CASCADE em ipm.group_role)
    OB->>M: observed absent
    M->>DB: Operation completed, apaga a linha, outbox updated removed
  end
